= Solution
{parent=i}

**False.** The <complete bipartite graph> $K_{3,3}$ has <chromatic number> two, but is nonplanar. For example a simple bipartite plane graph has $e\leq2v-4$, because all facial cycles have length at least four; $K_{3,3}$ has $v=6$, $e=9>8$.

